{"availability":"available","full":"sx4im/skillcheck","name":"skillcheck","description":"Blind A/B testing for AI agent skills, .cursorrules, CLAUDE.md, and system prompts. Detects placebo and harmful instructions.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":28,"forks":6,"created":"2026-06-04T14:23:07Z","updated":"2026-10-06T16:46:54Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://skillcheck.page","topics":["ab-testing","agent-skills","agentic-ai","ai-agents","benchmark","claude-code","cli","copilot-instructions","cursor-rules","cursorrules","developer-tools","evals","llm","llm-eval","prompt-engineering","prompt-evaluation","prompt-testing","system-prompts","typescript","windsurf"],"demo":"https://skillcheck.page/#leaderboard","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T11:14:42.922Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-07T11:14:42.922Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-07T11:14:42.922Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-04T06:50:50.352Z","stars":28,"forks":6},{"at":"2026-10-05T05:50:31.686Z","stars":28,"forks":6},{"at":"2026-10-07T11:14:42.922Z","stars":28,"forks":6}],"technologies":["React","Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Controlled A/B testing for AI agent skills, .cursorrules, CLAUDE.md, and system prompts — measure whether agent instructions actually improve model performance or just waste context tokens.","Not a syntax linter or basic assertion check — a controlled scientific experiment that measures statistical effect size.","Most published SKILL.md files, .cursorrules, and agent prompts have never been tested against an unprompted baseline. You cannot tell whether they help your model, make it worse, or are purely decorative prompt bloat. Skillcheck replaces vibe checks with empirical AI evaluation: paired control vs. treatment trials, blind grading, and bootstrap confidence intervals."],"features":["Ship skills with evidence — before you publish a Claude Code, Codex, or Cursor","Prompt A/B testing in one co